<title>UK: HORSE RACING-ENTREPRENEUR WINS ENGLISH 2,000 GUINEAS.</title>
<headline>HORSE RACING-ENTREPRENEUR WINS ENGLISH 2,000 GUINEAS.</headline>
<dateline>NEWMARKET 1997-05-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Entrepreneur, an 11-2 chance ridden by Michael Kinane, won the English 2,000 Guineas horse racing classic on Saturday.</p>
